Tammes15/Vendor/EM8/ holds 140 Lean files taken from Energy-Minimization-8-Points
(github.com/lukasliehr/Energy-Minimization-8-Points, commit 50d14bc06bd41f61573eb6a36eedb8d00759af8f,
directory LeanCode/LargeS/Lean_Code), the Lean formalization accompanying Kryvonos, Liehr and
Taylor, arXiv 2609.22077. That repository carries no licence file at that commit. Each file names
its source in its header; the changes are listed in THIRD_PARTY.md.

code/impl1/enum/plantri-guide.txt is the file plantri-guide.txt of plantri 5.8
(users.cecs.anu.edu.au/~bdm/plantri/plantri58.tar.gz), unchanged, Copyright Gunnar Brinkmann and
Brendan McKay, Apache License 2.0 (its Appendix G).

The package is built on Mathlib, Copyright (c) the respective Mathlib authors, Apache License 2.0.
